.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# the ring's live runtime files (see state/README.md)
state/state
state/mood.json
state/wave.json
# your personal config, created at setup: never tracked, never touched by updates
barehands.json
# throwaway prototypes (e.g. the cut-plane harness) — never shipped
scratch/

# render-test output (regenerated by tests/test_visual.py)
tests/_shots/
# generated by tests/test_gesture.mjs (copies of js/medical/*)
tests/cutgest/

# local research inputs and conversion outputs; patient data belongs in approved
# external private storage, never this public repository
/data/
/artifacts/
/private-data/
# scan-derived bundles you build locally (pipeline/build.py --out media/local/...):
# inside the media airlock so the board can stage them, never committed
/media/local/
